<title>BELGIUM: Belgium's Generale Bank to open Birmingham branch.</title>
<headline>Belgium's Generale Bank to open Birmingham branch.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's biggest bank, Generale Bank, said on Thursday it had decided to open a branch office in the northern British city of Birmingham as part of its strategy of developing a global presence.</p>
<p>The bank, founded in 1822, has had a branch in London since 1909 and opened a branch in the city of Reading a year ago.</p>
<p>Generale Bank is already present in France, the Netherlands and Germany.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
